[245.057017, "o", "283:    on_load: EventType[()] | None = None\r\n303:            on_load=self.on_load if self.on_load is not None else other.on_load,\r\n392:    # A map from a page route to the component to render. Users should use `add_page`.\r\n864:    def add_page(\r\n871:        on_load: EventType[()] | None = None,\r\n886:            on_load: The event handler(s) that will be called each time the page load.\r\n925:            # walking the call stack from add_page's caller.\r\n934:            on_load=on_load,\r\n969:            (on_load if isinstance(on_load, list) else [on_load])\r\n970:            if on_load is not None\r\n1205:        that raises propagates (fail fast, like ``add_page``), since it was\r\n1260:            self.add_page(render, **kwargs)\r\n"]
