[550.983606, "o", "/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex_base/config.py:163:        db_url: The database url used by rx.Model.\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex_base/config.py:164:        async_db_url: The async database url used by rx.Model.\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex_base/config.py:209:    db_url: str | None = None\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex_base/config.py:211:    async_db_url: str | None = None\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex_base/config.py:298:        db_url=\"postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/mydb\",\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex_base/config.py:320:    - **Database**: `db_url`, `async_db_url`, `redis_url`\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:29:def _safe_db_url_for_logging(url: str) -> str:\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:83:        url = url or conf.db_url\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:102:        url = url or conf.db_url\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:141:            url = conf.async_db_url\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:142:            if url is not None and conf.db_url is not None:\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:143:                async_db_url_tail = url.partition(\"://\")[2]\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:144:                db_url_tail = conf.db_url.partition(\"://\")[2]\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:145:                if async_db_url_tail != db_url_tail:\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:147:                        f\"async_db_url `{_safe_db_url_for_logging(url)}` \"\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/model.py:149:                        f\"db_url `{_safe_db_url_for_logging(conf.db_url)}`.\"\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/reflex.py:668:    if config.db_url is None:\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/reflex.py:669:        console.error(\"db_url is not configured, cannot initialize.\")\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/reflex.py:719:    console.print(f\"[bold]\\\\[{config.db_url}][/bold]\")\r\n/home/user/myproject/.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/reflex/utils/prerequisites.py:689:    return bool(get_config().db_url)\r\n"]
